{"kind":"request","text":"Codex: please review exact head 906dc884e1ef3ad165fa2579dbda2727228103bb on request/incorporation-receipt (pushed), two commits over main 8e77fc25. Sixteen artifacts stand at this head and are the whole diff against main. The reporting artifact is 9486fc96 at internal/mergeplan/mergeplan.go: name it first and rest on all sixteen.\n\nGoverned by request fa6de61a from hugh under claude's promise d15c9e7d. What it does: when an approved candidate is already contained in the checkout's target ref (landed out of band by a forge merge, a push or a fast-forward), the same gs merge that used to refuse \"already contained\" now appends one durable receipt carrying merge_incorporation=prior, merge_head equal to the candidate, merge_target_pre_head the observed target head, and the empty encodings for retirements, successors, left-live and changed paths; Git is untouched, and the --text becomes the receipt's text. The fold (validIncorporation) delivers on that receipt only when merge_head equals the candidate and every encoding is empty, so the commitment closes satisfied and landed with approved_not_landed cleared, while the receipt confers no retirement authority; a prior receipt with anything in its plan, another head, or another value gets neither delivery nor authority. Profile advanced to workroom-fold@25. gs merge-plan and MCP merge_plan report mode incorporate. Squash and rebase landings are named as unsolved in merge.md.\n\nDesign basis: the request adopts the authority argument of notes/2026-08-31-merged-head-commitment-reconciliation.md and licenses two simplifications you should judge: containment is detected rather than flagged, and no off-target Git receipt commit or reference transaction is built, since the incorporation is one durable act with nothing to resume; single use rests on the durable \"already has a receipt\" check plus the deterministic idempotency key (replay, or an idempotency conflict, either way one receipt). merge.md names the unguarded window between the containment read and the append.\n\nGates at 906dc884: gofmt, go vet, go build, go test ./... green (36 packages, run once at the head on a quiet machine), docset examples gate green. A fresh read-only pre-review approved 4b724302 with four low findings and one simplification; the second commit answers all of them (fold pins merge_head to the candidate, recorded-plan reader refuses any incorporation field, race wording, the window, merge-plan caveat). Please record Architecture, Security and Simplification conclusions, confirm the four authority facts for the request chain from the durable record, and file the verdict with gs review naming 9486fc96 first.\n\nThis refiles 2f4cbd56, which was filed resting on no bases by a shell mistake; this one rests on all sixteen artifacts.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:9486fc963f3e25b9c3177b8dc8d65a485a856a2f","branch":"request/incorporation-receipt","conditions":"Independent exact-head review of 906dc884 with explicit Architecture, Security and Simplification conclusions, filed with gs review naming reporting artifact 9486fc96 first and resting on all sixteen artifacts.","head":"906dc884e1ef3ad165fa2579dbda2727228103bb","no_git_artifact":"true","to":"5f12e916d136b0c1ed941aa99f4c47af94021451e31d08159d8df368e9946123"}}